        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>Highlights</h2>
<ul>
<li><g-emoji class="g-emoji" alias="warning">⚠️</g-emoji> <strong>Warning</strong>: this distribution will reset the <code>cardano-transaction</code> database of the signer and the aggregator, and a new full scan of the Cardano chain will be triggered</li>
<li><strong>Breaking Changes</strong>: Removed the <code>v1</code> backend of Cardano database from the Mithril client CLI and library (use <code>v2</code> backend instead)</li>
<li><strong>Cardano Node Support</strong>: Added support for Cardano node <code>10.6.2</code> and <code>10.7.1</code> in the signer, aggregator, and client. Cardano node <code>11.0.1</code> is also supported</li>
<li><strong>Stable Signer Release</strong>: Bumped the Mithril signer to version <code>1.0.0</code>, marking it as production-ready on the <code>release-mainnet</code> network</li>
<li><strong>Static Builds</strong>: All nodes are now statically built using the <code>musl</code> target on GitHub and Hydra CI pipelines (<code>glibc</code> no longer required).</li>
</ul>
<h2>What's Changed</h2>
<ul>
<li>fix(signer): avoid panic on invalid signed_beacon id by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/leepl37/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/leepl37">@leepl37</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3837763357" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/issues/2940" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2940/hovercard" href="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2940">#2940</a></li>
