        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>Highlights</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Breaking Changes</strong>: Progress bars and spinners now output to <code>stderr</code> instead of <code>stdout</code> in Mithril client CLI</li>
<li><strong>Deprecations</strong>: Deprecated <code>cardano_db</code> function in library/WASM; removed <code>snapshot</code> function from <code>Client</code> struct; deprecated <code>--backend v1</code> flag in CLI (use <code>--backend v2</code> instead)</li>
<li><strong>Decentralization Support</strong>: New <code>/protocol-configuration/{epoch}</code> route for fetching aggregator configuration; refactored signer and aggregator to read network configurations from <code>MithrilNetworkConfigurationProvider</code>; follower aggregators can now read configurations from leader aggregator</li>
<li><strong>Miscellaneous</strong>: Replaced CExplorer API with Blockfrost API for pool names/tickers discovery; support for new Lagrange Mithril era; bug fixes and performance improvements</li>
<li><strong>Unstable</strong>: DMQ protocol support in signer, aggregator and relay; aggregator discovery mechanism in client library and CLI.</li>
</ul>
<h2>What's Changed</h2>
<ul>
<li>Decentralization of configuration parameters phase 1 - new aggregator route by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/turmelclem/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/turmelclem">@turmelclem</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3524894312" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/issues/2741" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2741/hovercard" href="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2741">#2741</a></li>
<li>fix: Rust <code>1.91</code> clippy warnings by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Alenar/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Alenar">@Alenar</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3574395825" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/issues/2757" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2757/hovercard" href="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2757">#2757</a></li>
