        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>Highlights</h2>
<div class="markdown-alert markdown-alert-warning"><p class="markdown-alert-title"><svg data-component="Octicon" class="octicon octicon-alert mr-2" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6.457 1.047c.659-1.234 2.427-1.234 3.086 0l6.082 11.378A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.082 15H1.918a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.543-2.575Zm1.763.707a.25.25 0 0 0-.44 0L1.698 13.132a.25.25 0 0 0 .22.368h12.164a.25.25 0 0 0 .22-.368Zm.53 3.996v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 11a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z"></path></svg>Warning</p><p>🔥 This version fixes a bug in the <a href="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/releases/2543.0">2543.0</a> distribution which can prevent the Mithril signer to sign when (re)started.</p>
<p>Make sure you are using the <strong>Mithril signer</strong> with version <code>0.2.276</code>.</p>
</div>
<h2>What's Changed</h2>
<ul>
<li>add cardano db verify step in the CI that fails on expected tampered/missing files by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/turmelclem/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/turmelclem">@turmelclem</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3398500447" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/issues/2685" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2685/hovercard" href="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2685">#2685</a></li>
