        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>Highlights</h2>
<ul>
<li>Support for default incremental backend (v2) for Cardano database restoration in the client library, CLI and WASM</li>
<li>Support for enhanced verification of a Cardano database which provides a list of tampered and missing files in case of failure in the client library and CLI</li>
<li>Support for artifacts retrieval by epoch for the Cardano database and Cardano stake distribution in the client library, CLI and WASM</li>
<li>Deprecation of the <code>with_aggregator_client</code> and <code>new</code> functions in the <code>ClientBuilder</code> struct of the client library</li>
<li>Bug fixes and performance improvements.</li>
</ul>
<h2>What's Changed</h2>
<ul>
<li>add cardano db verify step in the CI that fails on expected tampered/missing files by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/turmelclem/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/turmelclem">@turmelclem</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3398500447" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/issues/2685" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2685/hovercard" href="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2685">#2685</a></li>
<li>fix: flakiness in e2e tests in the CI by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jpraynaud/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jpraynaud">@jpraynaud</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3402802327" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/issues/2688" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2688/hovercard" href="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2688">#2688</a></li>
<li>fix: docker client command in documentation by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jpraynaud/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jpraynaud">@jpraynaud</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3422317830" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/issues/2695" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2695/hovercard" href="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2695">#2695</a></li>
<li>docs: final CHANGELOG for '2537.0' distribution by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jpraynaud/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jpraynaud">@jpraynaud</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3425324563" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/issues/2696" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2696/hovercard" href="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2696">#2696</a></li>
