        <div data-pjax="true" data-test-selector="body-content" data-view-component="true" class="markdown-body tmp-my-3"><h2>Highlight</h2>
<ul>
<li>Support for <code>Cardano node</code> <code>10.5.1</code> in the signer and the aggregator</li>
<li>Support for stable <code>cardano_database_v2</code> backend in the <code>mithril-client</code> library</li>
<li>Support for stable <code>v2</code> backend of <code>cardano-db</code> command and decommission of  <code>cardano-db-v2</code> command in client CLI</li>
<li>Support for stable <code>verify</code> command to verify an existing Cardano database in the client CLI</li>
<li>Support for stable UTxO-HD snapshot converter <code>tools utxo-hd snapshot-converter</code> command in client CLI</li>
<li>Support for pre-built Linux ARM binaries for the signer, client CLI, and aggregator</li>
<li>Support for the Rust <code>2024</code> edition (from <code>2021</code> edition)</li>
<li>Bug fixes and performance improvements.</li>
</ul>
<h2>What's Changed</h2>
<ul>
<li>Organize STM - Module Parameters by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/curiecrypt/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/curiecrypt">@curiecrypt</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3121534359" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/issues/2553" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2553/hovercard" href="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2553">#2553</a></li>
<li>fix: rename artifact on wasm test failure in <code>Mithril Client multi-platform test</code> workflow. by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/dlachaume/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/dlachaume">@dlachaume</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3136722484" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/issues/2566" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2566/hovercard" href="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2566">#2566</a></li>
<li>fix: bytes codec in STM library by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jpraynaud/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jpraynaud">@jpraynaud</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3124947585" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/issues/2556" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2556/hovercard" href="https://github.com/input-output-hk/mithril/pull/2556">#2556</a></li>
